  {
   "id": "text-120-120c0560",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 1097.0,
   "width": 1680,
   "height": 70.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
   "seed": 1271841579,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1369847654,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792500000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rules applied by the server\nConflict rule: financial rows (invoice, invoice_item, payment, expense, ledger, daily_closing) with an older version from another device -> CONFLICT, nothing written, shown in Settings \u2192 Conflicts.\nSame device sending an older copy (late retry) -> SUPERSEDED (acked).  Catalog rows (customers, products, rooms, tables\u2026) -> last writer wins by version, then updated_at.\nTwo devices closing the same day: latest CLOSED row wins, the other points to it via superseded_by (never deleted).  Bad legacy totals are imported as-is and flagged (legacy_mismatch).",
   "originalText": "Rules applied by the server\nConflict rule: financial rows (invoice, invoice_item, payment, expense, ledger, daily_closing) with an older version from another device -> CONFLICT, nothing written, shown in Settings \u2192 Conflicts.\nSame device sending an older copy (late retry) -> SUPERSEDED (acked).  Catalog rows (customers, products, rooms, tables\u2026) -> last writer wins by version, then updated_at.\nTwo devices closing the same day: latest CLOSED row wins, the other points to it via superseded_by (never deleted).  Bad legacy totals are imported as-is and flagged (legacy_mismatch).",
